"target=\"blank\">Default</a></li><li><a "
"href=\"@img_folder_path/example_plain.png\" "
"target=\"blank\">Plain</a></li><li><a "
"href=\"@img_folder_path/example_stockholm_syndrome.png\" "
"target=\"blank\">Stockholm Syndrome</a></li><li><a "
